  "status": "present",
  "value": "grid is a list of equal-length rows over P (parking, height 0), - (building) and X (unusable, no height and no adjacency constraint). The height of a building tile is the fewest orthogonal moves from it to a P tile through non-X tiles. Return the largest building height; 0 when there is no building tile; -1 when some building tile cannot reach any P (its height is unbounded).",
